// The boss's spin, phase 2 only: 102 ticks, the default spin
// (docs/architecture.md section 11, "Boss 的模型和动画"): startup 0-50,
// active 50-62, recovery 62-102. Each part has keyframes at its ends.
// Rotations are YXZ degrees about each bone's position along the model's
// axes; see assets/anims/README.md.
//
// The whole body turns on the spot by the root, about the node's origin;
// the game leaves the node's facing alone. 0: standing. 22: lifting the
// halberd level, turning right. 50: wound up, turned right a quarter and
// coiled further, the halberd held level in both hands out behind. 51 to
// 62: one key a tick, 30 degrees each, a full turn to the left with the
// halberd out to the right, from behind round the right, the front and the
// left to behind again (the hit is a 360 degree sector swept the same way).
// 75: the turn running on a little. 90: facing forward again, lowering
// the halberd. 102: standing.
